ds. Oda went on to work as an assistant to some of the biggest manga artists in the industry, including Nobuhiro Watsuki, before winning the Hop Step Award for new artists. His pirate adventure One Piece, which debuted in Weekly Shonen Jump magazine in 1997, quickly became one of the most popular manga in Japan.\nL34: \nL35: 【22†Image†de7i3bh7bgh0d.cloudfront.net】\nL36: ### How Netflix Brought One Piece to Life—Literally!\nL37: \nL38: Go backstage in Set Sail: The Art and Making of One Piece.\nL39: \nL40: 【23†Watch trailer】\nL41: \nL42: 【24†Order now】\nL43: \nL44: 【25†Image†de7i3bh7bgh0d.cloudfront.net】\nL45: \nL46: ### A Message That Will Shake the World\nL47: \nL48: Catch up on the action in One Piece, Vol. 111!\nL49: \nL50: 【26†Read preview】\nL51: \nL52: 【27†Order now】\nL53: \nL54: 【28†Image†de7i3bh7bgh0d.cloudfront.net】\nL55: \nL56: ### The Ultimate One Piece Collector’s Guide\nL57: \nL58: Read chapters for free, find sales, and more!\nL59: \nL60: 【29†Learn more】\nL61: \nL62: 【30†Image†de7i3bh7bgh0d.cloudfront.net】\nL63: ### The Making of a Warlord of the Sea\nL64: \nL65: Read a free excerpt of the light novel One Piece: Law’s Story.\nL66: \nL67: 【23†Watch trailer】\nL68: \nL69: 【31†Read preview】\nL70: \nL71: 【32†Image†de7i3bh7bgh0d.cloudfront.net】\nL72: \nL73: ### Luffy Finds a New Technique—Gear 5!\nL74: \nL75: The war in Wano continues in One Piece (3-in-1), Vol. 35.\nL76: \nL77: 【33†Order now】\nL78: \nL79: ### Read One Piece manga and books\nL80: #### One Piece, Vol. 112\nL81: \nL82: It’s a happy reunion in Elbaph as Robin and Saul are finally together again! But while the Straw Hats celebrate and begin exploring their mysterious new surroundings, something evil may have just snuck in as well…\nL83: \nL84: 【34†Buy now】\nL85: ### Other One Piece volumes\nL86: \nL87: 【35†See all >】\nL88: \nL89: Pre-Order\nL90: \nL91: Manga\nL92: \nL93: 【36†One Piece, Vol. 113】\nL94: \nL95: Art Book\nL96: \nL97: 【24†Set Sail: The Art and Making of One Piece】\nL98: \nL99: Manga\n